1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Another name for Giert was Giert Svendsen Eeg.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT General Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1738 the Boslet farm in Askim was taken over by Giert Svendsen.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Medical Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT He was 70 years old when he died.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Giert married Sigri Iversdatter Aaser, daughter of Iffuer Siøpharsen Aaser and Randi Sæbiørnsdatter, in 1738. (Sigri Iversdatter Aaser was born circa 1708 and died in 1740.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT They lived on the Boslet farm in Askim.
2 CONT
2 CONT Giert also married Clara Clausdatter after 1740. (Clara Clausdatter died in 1748.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Giert also married Anne Halvorsdatter after 1748.
