1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Engebret was from Elvestad in Eidsberg. He bouth the Søndre Ilen farm in 1758 for 620rdl. In 1762 he sold half the farm to his son Kristen for 310rdl. Three years later he bought it back for the same amount. In 1773 Engebret sold 
2 CONC the entire farm to his sons Peder and Kristen and søndre Ilen was divided between them.
